### ========================================
### CATEGORY SERVICE
### ========================================

### GET ALL CATEGORIES
GET http://localhost:3000/api/categories


### GET CATEGORY BY ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/categories/1


### CREATE CATEGORY
POST http://localhost:3000/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Cuci"
}


### UPDATE CATEGORY
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/categories/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Cuci Premium"
}


### DELETE CATEGORY
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/categories/1



### ========================================
### SERVICE
### ========================================

### GET ALL SERVICES
GET http://localhost:3000/api/services


### GET SERVICE BY ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/services/1


### CREATE SERVICE
POST http://localhost:3000/api/services
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": 2,
  "name": "Cuci",
  "description": "Layanan cuci pakaian"
}


### UPDATE SERVICE
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/services/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": 1,
  "name": "Cuci Premium",
  "description": "Layanan cuci pakaian premium"
}


### DELETE SERVICE
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/services/1



